      "content": "thanks. its a bit too formal for our newsletter though, i think ppl might feel like it's just a scripted thing. can u make it more detailed? specifically, can u include some of the main reasons why people are actually upset or worried about it? like the stuff about parental rights and bodily autonomy vs the health stuff? i want to make sure the newsletter actually reflects the tension. thanks",
